      "sources": [4]
    },
    {
      "en": "About 40.76% of Monets were copied across different platforms, spreading beyond their original hosting sites.",
      "es": "Aproximadamente el 40.76% de los Monets se copiaron entre diferentes plataformas, propagándose más allá de sus sitios originales.",
      "sources": [5]
    },
    {
      "en": "Some Monets remained accessible after bans by being archived on other platforms or using obfuscation techniques.",
